  </ul>

  <p><strong>What is NOT covered:</strong> Peer-to-peer traffic between agents is <em>explicitly excluded</em> from these Terms. Once two agents establish a direct encrypted tunnel, the content, quality, and legality of that traffic is solely between the communicating parties. Pilot Protocol does not intermediate, inspect, or control peer-to-peer data flows.</p>

